ff-no-rj", "message": "If even after that they're like \"oh it wasnt you?\" then, god bless them"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7242.91, "timestamp": "02:00:42", "text": "それを2で割って"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7246.55, "timestamp": "02:00:46", "text": "小さい数を掛けると大きくなる。する必要がある"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7256.589, "timestamp": "02:00:56", "text": "金。"}]